embark on a bold new journey in rising  tide the upcoming expansion to  civilization beyond Earth lead your  civilization into the unknown brave the  brutal hostility of frigid worlds and  command the fear for respect of other  leaders as you shift the tide of the  political landscape with all new  enhanced diplomatic features a strong  leader has nothing without a land to  rule over and in a rising tide new  biomes await with challenges and  benefits of their own the frozen  wastelands of the frigid biome hide new  alien threats and Geographic obstacles  but are ripe with hidden artifacts and  new marvels this treacherous wilderness  has much to offer new civilizations if  they can withstand the cold as the first  wave of colony ships rose to leave earth  behind they left in their wake several  civilizations that had not yet conceded  to the fate presented by the great  mistake with worldwide sea levels rising  many island nations reshaped themselves  to better survive life on the high seas  as a result when these societies emerged  from the global Dark Age and began  seeding new worlds of their own they  brought with them new technologies  better suited for an aquatic life  the North Sea Alliance led by the  stalwarts Scotsman Duncan Hughes  recognized the importance of being ready  for any situation and fashioned their  colony ships to allow for both land and  water landings likewise the German  political party integer emerged from the  Dark Age with a stronger understanding  of the need for successful cohabitation  with the worlds they would call home led  by the for thinking humanist Lena Abner  the integer Party builds their new  civilizations around the pillars of  sustainability innovation and diversity  living behind the irresponsible  extravagance that had doomed the world  they left behind with the emergence of  new factions came a diplomatic  revolution in her icing type the  diplomacy system has been enhanced to  give players new and improved ways to  interact with neighboring civilizations  as times change people change to reflect  this in a rising tide each civilizations  leader will now be able to develop  unique traits that evolve with them over  the course of a game character traits  give each leader you encounter a new  political spin shaping their attitudes  and responses to your actions of  diplomacy or war in addition players can  now assign traits to aspects of their  society like politics domestic  infrastructure and military might each  trait will further specialize your  society grant unique advantages and open  new pathways to coerce and conquer other  civilizations with the addition of  traits comes the opportunity to create  mutually beneficial agreements with  other leaders by pledging services to  another nation in exchange for their  services or political resources you can  further improve your diplomatic  positioning the stronger a relationship  is between two civilizations the more  impactful their agreements benefits  become the wisest leaders will be those  who use agreements to the  advantage align themselves with the  right political partners and striking  when the time is right to take full  advantage of the dealings they made in  addition to new traits and agreements  rising tide introduces two new  diplomatic measures fear and respect if  your nation takes a distinct lead in  military economic or political standing  other nations may become fearful of your  overwhelming power this fear can be used  to your advantage  to strong-arm other civilizations into  trades and agreements that are in your  favor but be cautious as other nations  may begin to conspire against you behind  your back if you prefer a more amicable  approach you can work to foster the  respect other leaders have for you a  leaders respect for you is improved by  playing into their specific leader  traits take actions that appeal to their  traits and they will look favorably upon  you allowing for the formation of  stronger agreements and better trade  conditions this was a further look into  the ever-changing landscape of a rising  tide in part three we'll reveal the  remaining factions explore the new types  of relationships you can foster with  other civilizations and examine the  exciting next evolution of the affinity  system coming to civilization beyond  Earth rising tide  you
 

